  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children learn and are safe - Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with civil society, academia and Government, the program will seek to support  learning outcomes for the most marginalised groups of children (girls, children with disabilities,etc). This will include policy development, advocacy, teacher training amongst others. Other partners: J.F. Kapnek Trust, Leonard Cheshire Disability Trust Zimabwe, University of Zimbabwe, Education Coalition of Zimbabwe (ECOZI), Ministry of Primary and Secondary Education District Level</narrative>
  </description>
